1
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,920
You're leaving so early today.

2
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:37,760
You're awake.

3
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,600
I was trying

4
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,120
not to wake you up.

5
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,720
Xiaorou

6
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,800
took a long leave

7
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,360
for some reason.

8
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:49,960
So I have to

9
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,360
handle a lot of things.

10
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,080
When will you come back tonight?

11
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,600
Well,

12
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
I'm not sure.

13
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,400
The press conference is approaching,

14
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,240
and there are many things to deal with.

15
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,000
Go back to sleep.

16
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:13,520
Okay.

17
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,600
I'm leaving.

18
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:22,520
Okay.

19
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:39,040
But the woman who painted these paintings

20
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:42,120
is the woman Mr. Zhou can never forget.

21
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,520
Su,

22
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,480
Mu,

23
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:45,920
Chen.

24
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:48,880
Impossible.

25
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:51,800
Su Muchen has been dead for a long time.

26
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,400
These paintings

27
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,440
were stored here by her.

28
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:57,280
When Mr. Zhou first joined the company,

29
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,120
he was short of money.

30
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,080
Su Muchen went to the studio

31
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,320
she went to the studio as an assistant

32
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,600
in secret.

33
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,400
Sometimes she used Purple Vine

34
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,640
as her pen name.

35
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:08,840
She asked me to sell the paintings to make a living.

36
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:12,480
A few years ago, I needed money,

37
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,000
so I sold the paintings to the gallery.

38
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,320
I didn't expect

39
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,440
Mr. Zhou bought them at once.

40
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:19,960
After that,

41
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,800
whenever I gave him a painting,

42
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,720
he would buy it immediately.

43
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,080
I guess

44
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,520
he also found the deep affection

45
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,280
in every stroke

46
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,440
of these paintings.

47
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,640
How do you know so much?

48
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,280
What's your relationship with Su Muchen?

49
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,200
Because I used to be

50
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,040
her best friend.

51
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,160
Even Mr. Zhou's entry into the company

52
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,920
was arranged by Su Muchen with my help.

53
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,720
In fact,

54
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,800
I'm the matchmaker

55
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,560
of you and Mr. Zhou.

56
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,840
Isn't it ironic?

57
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,960
Even if Annie buries the past deep,

58
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,960
it can't change the fact

59
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,160
that you, the daughter of the Lu family,

60
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,600
were once a mistress.

61
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:16,120
You've done a good job

62
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,080
over the years.

63
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,880
Now that it's come to this,

64
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,280
I'll take a long vacation

65
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,920
and leave Lucheng in the next few days.

66
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,880
I'll leave the resignation procedures

67
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,560
to you.

68
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,400
Oh,

69
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,400
by the way,

70
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:40,080
considering our years of friendship,

71
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,560
I'll tell you one last secret.

72
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,520
Do you really think

73
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,680
Jiang Li became Lu Xu's fiancée

74
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:48,400
just by coincidence?

75
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,040
Yan,

76
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:28,000
hasn't Lu Xu been home these days?

77
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,920
The young master hasn't come back

78
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,920
since the second day of the wedding.

79
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,760
When did Jiang Li

80
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,320
leave today?

81
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,840
Ms. Jiang left early this morning

82
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:42,960
with Mr. Ke

83
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:43,880
this morning.

84
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,600
Alright.

85
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:49,840
You can go now.

86
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:50,480
Okay.

87
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,320
Wait.

88
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,000
Mumu loves fish the most.

89
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,720
Why didn't she eat any?

90
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:01,120
The cook left a few bones

91
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,720
in the fish today.

92
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,440
I'm afraid he would choke,

93
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,240
so we replaced it with abalone porridge.

94
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:10,640
Once Annie dilutes your shares,

95
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:11,520
you'll have no bargaining chips.

96
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,960
You won't even be able to support Mumu.

97
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,080
Come on,

98
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:23,960
pour the wine.

99
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:24,880
Three sixes.

100
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,280
Drink more.

101
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,320
Four sixes.

102
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,720
Four sixes.

103
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:32,440
Open.

104
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,480
Ah.

105
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:35,800
Look who's there.

106
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:41,600
Who's that?

107
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,520
What a buzzkill.

108
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,560
Who is she?

109
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,680
Get out of here.

110
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,080
What's wrong, Young Master Lu?

111
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,600
Who is she?

112
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,200
Get out.

113
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,080
Let's go.

114
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,160
Your engagement with Jiang Li

115
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,480
was just a show

116
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,680
for me to see.

117
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:13,400
Did Li Xiaorou tell you that?

118
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,120
I haven't seen her these days.

119
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:18,600
Lu Qianqian,

120
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,120
except for you,

121
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:22,440
I'm just flirting with others.

122
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:25,120
Aren't you afraid I'll tell Mother about this?

123
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,560
Between giving up a son-in-law

124
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,400
and keeping a son,

125
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,840
do you think

126
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,400
to keep a son?

127
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,320
You should know better than I do.

128
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,840
Besides,

129
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,360
you already know

130
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,480
that we are

131
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,160
not related by blood,

132
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,000
don't you?

133
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,640
You sent someone to spy on me in Singapore?

134
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,640
Jiang Li's report

135
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,640
is much more frequent than you know.

136
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,280
Did you tell Mom?

137
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,680
Whether she knows or not

138
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,200
depends on you.

139
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,680
Are you going to be the good girl of the Lu family,

140
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,480
or my accomplice?

141
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,120
You're not surprised at all.

142
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,160
You knew it all along.

143
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,640
Of course, I'm not surprised.

144
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,480
I knew it ten years ago.

145
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,440
To be honest,

146
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,320
I was so excited that I couldn't sleep all night.

147
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:29,480
Stop it.

148
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,320
Zhou Jian and I

149
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:33,040
will never get a divorce.

150
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:36,600
Sister.

151
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,160
Jingmo.

152
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,360
You've been back for years.

153
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,360
It's time to stop wandering

154
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:05,560
and take on responsibilities at the company.

155
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,400
Grandpa.

156
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,560
The world is full of challenges.

157
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,160
I need more experience.

158
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,360
Oh,

159
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,080
how many years can I

160
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,960
protect you?

161
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,800
When your uncle and aunt

162
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:17,680
take over the company,

163
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,760
you'll be

164
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,760
crying

165
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,080
but can't even find a grave.

166
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,360
Grandpa,

167
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,400
you'll live a long life.

168
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,480
Don't say such unlucky words.

169
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:26,880
Then,

170
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,320
how about you move back in?

171
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,040
That way, I can see you every day.

172
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:30,720
What do you say?

173
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,320
If I really moved back,

174
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,800
you'd be tired of me

175
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:36,040
in three days.

176
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:36,840
Hmph!

177
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,320
You little rascal!

178
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:40,000
Who's the grandpa here,

179
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,840
you or me?

180
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,480
You are, of course.

181
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:45,400
Well,

182
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:46,440
by the way,

183
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:49,000
what about Yao Ting from Hongshou Insurance?

184
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:50,240
She's been waiting for you for half a year.

185
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,240
You don't even have dinner with her.

186
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:53,880
Yao Ting

187
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:54,960
is pretty

188
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,400
and smart.

189
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,400
It would hurt her more

190
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,280
if I meet her and reject her.

191
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,160
Then...

192
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,560
Tell me,

193
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,560
what exactly are you looking for?

194
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,160
Grandpa,

195
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,320
you promised me freedom in love.

196
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,240
Even if I marry a beggar,

197
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,360
you won't interfere.

198
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,640
That's what you said,

199
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,960
but bring a beggar back then.

200
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:16,560
Ah?

201
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,320
Now,

202
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,800
there's not even a trace.

203
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,360
I'm looking forward to holding your child.

204
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,680
Tell me the truth.

205
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:24,240
Do you have a boyfriend or not?

206
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,160
Grandpa,

207
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:26,240
when I find one,

208
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,440
I'll tell you for sure.

209
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,320
Okay?

210
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:29,600
Hmph!

211
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:30,480
Nonsense!

212
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:33,680
I've been in business for a lifetime.

213
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,240
I can see through you.

214
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,240
Tell me.

215
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,680
Who's the girl?

216
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,000
Well.

217
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,800
The girl in Jingmo's heart

218
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,000
is beautiful,

219
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,040
smart,

220
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,240
and has

221
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,560
great skills.

222
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,520
Well.

223
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,960
Even your sister-in-law knows it.

224
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,920
Tell me,

225
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,720
who is the girl?

226
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,440
You're kidding.

227
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:02,920
It's the first time

228
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,600
you've come to talk about business

229
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,080
in all these years.

230
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,960
If it's not for a girl,

231
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:10,160
I can't think of any other reason.

232
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,160
Hey,

233
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,240
don't try to get away with it.

234
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,240
Tell me.

235
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,160
Grandpa,

236
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,920
she's engaged.

237
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:18,080
Don't ask.

238
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,440
So what?

239
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,880
A goalkeeper

240
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,320
can't stop a goal?

241
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,680
Your grandma

242
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,200
was taken by your grandpa

243
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:27,000
with his charm.

244
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:27,880
Tell me,

245
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,800
Who is she?

246
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,120
I'll help you.

247
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:31,080
Grandpa,

248
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,120
it's getting late.

249
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,200
I'll go first.

250
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,120
Take care of yourself.

251
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:34,720
Ah.

252
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:35,800
Remember to take your medicine.

253
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,000
Ah.

254
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:37,960
You...

255
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,000
You want to run away again.

256
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,160
I'll see Jingmo off.

257
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:41,600
You brat,

258
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,520
if you don't bring a girl back next time,

259
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,800
don't come in.

260
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,840
No,

261
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,640
you must bring one back.

262
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,440
Did you hear that?

263
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,720
Ah,

264
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:55,440
that was the assistant of the Lu family,

265
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,480
just delivering a document on the way.

266
00:11:59,160 --> 00:11:59,720
Oh,

267
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,240
why do you

268
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:02,400
even care about

269
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,200
my visitors now?

270
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,480
It seems that you've set up a new trap.

271
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:08,040
I wonder which piece you're aiming at this time.

272
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,640
Zhou Jian refuses to fall into the trap,

273
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,640
and Jiang Li was taken away by you halfway.

274
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,040
I can't just

275
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,640
sit and wait to die, can I?

276
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:20,360
You always like to borrow strength.

277
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,160
I believe you can

278
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,800
break the deadlock

279
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:24,800
without hurting the harmony.

280
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,080
You can stop here.

281
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:49,440
Miss Lu.

282
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,360
The child has been picked up by his aunt.

283
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:52,840
Which aunt?

284
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,920
The one who came with you last time.

285
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,360
She said you had something urgent today.

286
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:06,920
Who allowed you to let a stranger take my child?

287
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,480
She...

288
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:08,920
She said you asked her to come.

289
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:19,080
Ah?

290
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,160
Help!

291
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,720
Put me down!

292
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:22,560
Jump!

293
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:23,720
You're from the Lu family.

294
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,080
This height won't kill you.

295
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:26,400
Aunt, put me down.

296
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,320
I'm scared.

297
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,160
Jump down,

298
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:29,880
and I'll buy you a new model of a robot.

299
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:30,440
I don't want it.

300
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,600
I want my mom.

301
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:32,800
Move aside.

302
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:33,840
Mumu,

303
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:34,680
don't be afraid.

304
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:35,640
Come down.

305
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,400
I can catch you.

306
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:38,240
Come on.

307
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,560
It's okay.

308
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,840
It's okay.

309
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:47,600
Take him to the car.

310
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,000
Okay.

311
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,680
Jiang Li,

312
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,040
what do you want to do?

313
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:58,520
I'm teaching him how to survive.

314
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,280
Do you remember this scar on my hand?

315
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:03,320
When I was his age,

316
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,720
I was pushed by older kids in the orphanage

317
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,360
into a cement pipe in a derelict building.

318
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,840
Guess how I survived?

319
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:10,680
I bit my teeth

320
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:13,200
and crawled out of the three-meter deep pipe.

321
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:14,800
My mouth was full of blood.

322
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,520
The Lu family

323
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,760
will never abandon us.

324
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:22,800
You've met Lu Xu, haven't you?

325
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:25,360
The bite marks on his mouth are left by you.

326
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:27,360
You'd better think it through.

327
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,920
Do you want to continue to be a canary in the shelter

328
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,640
or teach this child

329
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:33,200
to walk.

330
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:36,360
After all, when the Lu family has finished with you,

331
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,960
this child can still continue to run by himself.
